		"Name": "Liberty",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Taurian Concordat ended up with the lion's share of the Heavy Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Liberty LBT-OP. The Liberty, being the primary home-grown Concordat OmniMech, was the perfect chassis for testing the new weaponry on and made a satisfying home for the rifle. Armed with a Heavy Plasma Rifle, a LRM-20, and an SRM-6 (with Inferno munitions, naturally), the -OP is more than a match for anything on the Taurian borders.",
